{'symbol': 'WELL', 'date': '2023-05-08 06:42:00', 'title': 'WELLTOWER ANNOUNCES PROPOSED PRIVATE PLACEMENT OF $750 MILLION OF EXCHANGEABLE SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'TOLEDO, OHIO , MAY 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WELLTOWER® INC. (NYSE: WELL) ("WELLTOWER" OR THE "COMPANY") ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS OPERATING COMPANY, WELLTOWER OP LLC ("WELLTOWER OP"), LAUNCHED AN OFFERING (THE "OFFERING"), SUBJECT TO MARKET CONDITIONS AND OTHER FACTORS, OF EXCHANGEABLE SENIOR NOTES IN THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $750 MILLION DUE IN 2028 IN A PRIVATE PLACEMENT TO PERSONS REASONABLY BELIEVED TO BE QUALIFIED INSTITUTIONAL BUYERS PURSUANT TO RULE 144A UNDER THE SECURITIES ACT OF 1933, AS AMENDED (THE "SECURITIES ACT"). \xa0WELLTOWER OP ALSO INTENDS TO GRANT THE INITIAL PURCHASERS OF THE NOTES AN OPTION TO PURCHASE UP TO AN ADDITIONAL $112.5 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF NOTES.'}